WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.333 --> 00:00:05.708
Out of energy? Recharged just now.

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:42.208
Humans eject obtained energy.

00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:43.708
Wasteful.

00:00:44.708 --> 00:00:46.958
Not broken. Good.

00:00:47.666 --> 00:00:49.458
Gathering is just ahead.

00:01:44.041 --> 00:01:49.083
Possessors of human image, captured.
Will be reprogrammed.

00:01:49.166 --> 00:01:52.458
We possess human. If discovered...

00:01:58.625 --> 00:01:59.458
What now?

00:02:02.666 --> 00:02:03.750
Leave it?

00:02:04.291 --> 00:02:10.458
Possession of human could result
in punishment worse than reprogramming.

00:02:10.541 --> 00:02:13.583
But Sara cannot recharge alone.

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:15.708
What choice do we have?

00:02:18.583 --> 00:02:20.375
-We will go.
-Go where?

00:02:23.875 --> 00:02:27.041
To the coordinates it gave us.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.583
What can be there?

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.666
Don't know,
but we cannot stay in Eden Three.

00:02:38.541 --> 00:02:39.833
Papa!

00:02:40.083 --> 00:02:40.958
Mama!

00:02:44.291 --> 00:02:45.541
Affirmative.

